{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"○禮九","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"△謚法","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"至元三年，追謚成吉思汗以下諸汗，是為上尊謚之始。三十一年，世祖崩。夏四月甲午，成宗即位，丙午，右丞相完泽及文武百官議上大行皇帝尊謚。壬寅，為壇於都城南七里。甲辰，遣司徒兀都帶、平章政事不忽木、左丞張九思率百官請謚於南郊。五月戊午，遣攝太尉兀都帶奉册上尊謚、廟號及國語尊稱。是日，完泽等議同上先帝、先後宏吉剌氏尊謚。凡歷代上先帝、先後尊謚者，皆如之。至群臣賜謚，則始於中統二年賜金翰林修撰魏璠靖肅，補闕李大節謚貞肅。至大二年，定內外官三品以上者許請謚，若勋戚大臣賜謚不在此例。太常因革禮次謚法於諸神祀之下，今仍之。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"君謚","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"神一民無為曰神，應变無方曰神，能妙萬物曰神，聖不可知曰神，道化宣民曰神，顯仁试用曰神。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"聖極深研幾曰聖，窮理盡性曰聖，窮神知化曰聖，能享上帝曰聖，兼采眾謀曰聖。裁成天地曰聖，百姓與能曰聖，供物成器曰聖。備道全美曰聖。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"文經緯天地曰文，齒佑博聞曰文，修德來遠曰文，德洽四國曰文，微柔懿恭曰文，聖謚丕顯曰文，化成天下曰文，純穆不已曰文。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"武克定禍亂曰武，禁暴戢兵曰武，克有天下曰武，睿智不殺曰武，恤民除害曰武。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"成經德秉哲曰成，民和神福曰成，政立民安曰成，持盈守成曰成，道兼聖智曰成。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"康安樂撫民曰康，能安兆民曰康，俊民用章曰康，久膺多福曰康。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"獻聰明睿智曰獻，向惠德無曰獻，智质有聖曰獻","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"懿愛民质淵曰懿，體元居中曰懿，德浸光大曰懿。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"章法度大明曰章。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"穆布德執意曰穆，尊賢敬德曰穆，德政應和曰穆。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"敬威儀悉備曰敬，齊莊中正曰敬，全善典法曰敬，畏天愛民曰敬。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"元主善行德曰元，行義悅民曰元，體仁長人曰元。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"昭聖德嗣服曰昭，德業升聞曰昭，智能察微曰昭。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"景耆意大圖曰景，布義行刚曰景，繇義而成曰景，德行可仰曰景。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"孝协時肇享曰孝，博施被物曰孝，繼志述事曰孝，教刑四海曰孝，德通神明曰孝。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"宣施而無私曰宣，重光奠麗曰宣，義問周達曰宣。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"平布綱治紀曰平。治而無倦曰平，布德均政曰平，無党無偏曰平。治過如砥曰平。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"醒避土肢遠曰桓。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"莊威而不猛曰莊，端屬臨民曰莊。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"僖质淵學諫曰僖。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"肅刚德克就曰肅。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"惠慈仁好與曰惠，能安四方曰惠，子愛因窮曰惠，俭以厚下曰惠。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"安宽裕和平曰安，所寶惟賢曰安，兆民賴廣曰安，中心宅仁曰安，修已寧民曰安。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"明照臨四方曰明，請訴不行曰明，聖能作則口明，無幽不察曰明，任賢使能曰明。令聞不已曰明，奉苦天過曰明，孝法天下曰明，奉養有節曰明，遏惡扬善曰明，祝能致遠曰明。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"定安民法故曰定，安民大慮曰定，仁能一眾曰定，嗣成武功曰定。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"簡易從有功曰簡，平易無疵曰簡，至德臨下曰簡。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"隱不顯尸國曰隱。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"翼思慮深遠曰翼，小心事天曰翼。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"襄辟土有德曰襄。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"哀德之不建曰哀。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"烈秉德事業曰烈，海外有截曰烈，業成無競曰烈，丕承聖謨曰烈。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"威蠻夷率服曰威，信賞必罰曰威，德威可畏曰威。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"愍禍亂力作曰憋，使民悲傷曰愍，在國罹優曰愍。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"靈亂而不損曰靈，好事鬼神曰靈，極知神事曰靈。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"幽壅遏不遠曰幽，违禮亂常曰幽，暴民殘義曰幽。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"厲殺戮不辜曰厲。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"德　修文來遠曰德，睿智日新曰德，尊賢親親曰德，忠和純淑曰德。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"质中工無邪曰质，恬淡無為曰质。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"靖虛已鮮言曰靖，緝熙宥密曰靖，式典安民曰靖。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"順慈和遍服曰順，德合帝則曰順，受天百祿曰順。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"思追梅前過曰思。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"憲賞善罰奸曰憲，刑政四方曰憲，聖能法天曰憲。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"仁利泽萬世曰仁，大德好生曰仁，率性安行曰仁。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"義除去天地之害曰義，理财正辭曰義，仁能製命曰義，能成其志曰義。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"禮奉義順則曰禮。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"智察言知人曰智。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"钦克慎成憲曰钦。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"戴典禮不愆曰戴，愛民好治曰戴。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"懷慈仁短折曰懷，民思其惠曰懷。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"荒好內怠政曰荒，內外淫亂曰荒，昏亂紀度曰荒，狎侮五常曰荒。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"惑以欲忘追曰惑，淫溺丧志曰惑，婦言是用曰惑。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"夷失禮基亂曰夷。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"後妃謚","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"文克嗣微昔曰文。慈惠愛民曰文，德美才秀曰文。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"成夙夜警戒曰成，曲直赴禮曰成，仁化純禮曰成。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"康溫良好學曰康，寿考且守曰康，保民迪吉曰康，務德不爭曰康。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"獻賢德有成曰獻。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"懿溫柔聖善曰懿，柔克有光曰懿。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"章其言有文曰章，上下無私曰章。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"穆德化肅和曰穆。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"敬夙夜警戒曰敬，戒懼無违曰敬，戒尊師傅曰敬。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"元體仁內恕曰元，仁明道合曰元。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"昭容儀翼美曰昭，德禮不愆曰昭。商朗令終曰昭。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"孝慈惠愛親曰孝，尊仁安義曰孝，先意承志曰孝，能奉祭把曰孝，敬慎所安曰孝。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"宣聖善周聞曰宣，能布全德曰宣。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"平執事有製曰平，分不求多曰平。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"莊履正志和曰莊，端一克成曰莊，齊戒中禮曰莊。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"僖小心畏忌曰僖，見善用長曰僖。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"恭執心决斷曰恭，能執婦道曰恭。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"惠淑质受諫曰惠，恩能及下曰惠。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"安務德不爭曰安，莊敬盡禮曰安。敬而有禮曰安。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"明獨見先幻曰明，內治和禮曰明。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"定踐行不爽曰定，審於事情曰定，德操純固曰定。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"簡一德不懈曰簡。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"正其儀不戎曰正，精爽斋肅曰正，內外賓服曰正，誠心枯非曰正，莊以率下曰正。息邪距诐曰正。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"隱遠拂不成曰隱。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"哀遭難已甚曰哀。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"烈光有大功曰烈，安民有功曰烈。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"勤服勞無怨曰勤，能修其官曰勤。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"貞履正中饋曰貞，守數難犯曰貞，幽閒专一曰貞，恒德從一曰貞。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"靈死見鬼能曰靈，不勤成名曰靈。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"幽淫德滅國曰幽。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"厲挟邪违正曰厲，長舌階禍曰厲。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"節巧而好度曰節。能固所守曰節，恭俭中禮曰節，好廉自克曰節，直道不撓曰節，臨義不奪曰節。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"德富貴好禮曰德，仁而有化曰德，忧國進賢曰德。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"质心靡他曰质。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"靖柔教眾曰靖，宽樂全終曰靖。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"順比於禮曰順，柔德承天曰順，德性宽柔曰順，淑慎其身曰順，德容如玉曰順。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"憲行善可記曰憲。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"忠讓賢盡誠曰忠，危身奉上曰忠，中能應外曰忠。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"仁功施於民曰仁，屈已逮下曰仁。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"禮奉義順則曰禮。善自防閒曰禮。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"钦威儀悉備日钦。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"良順理習善曰良，溫敬寡言曰良，孝悌成性曰良，小心敬畏曰良。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"微元德充美曰微。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"柔順德麗貞曰柔，至順法坤曰柔。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"荒縱樂無度曰荒。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"惑心志多窮曰惑。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"戾不侮前過曰慶，不思順受曰慶。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"臣謚","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"文博聞多見曰文，敬直慈惠曰文，勤學好問曰文，修治班製曰文，與賢同升曰文。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"武除亂靖難曰武，帥眾以順曰武，折冲御侮曰武，赴敵無避曰武，辟土斥境曰武。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"成通達強立曰成，不忘久要曰成，佐相克忠曰成，德備禮樂曰成，德見於行曰成。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"康宽裕和平曰康，敬而有禮曰康，保衛社稷曰康，造道自行曰康，動而無妄曰康。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"獻博聞多能曰獻，智能翼君曰獻，學於古訓曰獻。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"懿文德充實曰懿，秉彝好德曰懿，尚能不爭曰懿。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"章溫克令儀曰章，敬慎高明曰章。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"穆申情見貌曰穆，敬和在位曰穆。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"敬夙夜將事曰敬，陳善閉邪曰敬，死不忘君曰敬，難而不避曰敬。受命不遷曰敬，眾方克就曰敬。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"元宣慈惠和曰元。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"昭明德有功曰昭。德音孔宣曰昭。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"孝秉德不回曰孝，思愛忘勞曰孝，從命不忿曰孝，富貴不驕曰孝，能守祭祀曰孝。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"宣俊達有德曰宣，力施四方曰宣。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"平政以行辟曰平，執事有製曰平，分不求多曰平。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"桓克敵服遠曰桓，壮以有力曰桓。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"莊德不矜曰莊。","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"僖小心敬慎曰僖。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"恭好德不怠曰恭，貌敬行祗曰恭。","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"惠宽裕不苛曰惠，柔质慈民曰惠，遺愛在民曰惠，分人以财曰惠，利而不費曰惠。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"安好和不爭曰安。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"明總集殊異曰明，能视致遠曰明，誠身自知曰明，守靜知常曰明。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"定以勞定國曰定，克綏邦家曰定。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"簡仕不躁進曰簡，能行直道曰簡。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"隱杯情不盡曰隱。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"襄執心克刚曰襄，协贊有成曰襄。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"哀處死非義曰哀。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"毅致果殺敵曰毅，勇而近仁曰毅，","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"勇持義不撓曰勇，以義死事曰勇，臨事屢斷曰勇，勝敵壮志曰勇，臨難不懼曰勇。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"壮勝敵克亂曰壮，死於原野曰壮，好力致勇曰壮，屢行征伐曰壮，武而不遂曰壮，武德刚毅曰壮。非禮弗履曰壮。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"克愛民作刑曰克，勝敵得俊曰克，勝已自私曰克。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"勤能修其官曰勤，廣業不怠曰勤，勤行世業曰勤，好學力行曰勤。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"貞大忠克就曰貞，直追不撓曰貞，清白守節曰貞，內外用情曰貞，不隱幽屏曰貞，圖國荒死曰貞，名實不爽曰貞，事君無猜曰貞，固節幹事曰貞。","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"愍佐國逢難曰愍。危身奉上曰愍。","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"幽暴民殘義曰幽。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"白涅而不淄曰白，致慮忘機曰白。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"德刚塞簡廉曰德，宽栗扰義曰德，直溫強義曰德，辅世長民曰德，富貴好禮曰德。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"匡辅弼王室曰匡，以法正國曰匡，弥縫灾害曰匡，正君之過曰匡。","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"质名實不爽曰质，言行相應曰质。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"靖仁敬鮮言曰靖。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"順慈仁和民曰順，克將君美曰順。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"憲文武可法曰憲。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"堅磨而不磷曰賢。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"忠臨患不忘國曰忠，慮國忘家曰忠，殺身報國曰忠，廉方公證曰忠，世篤勤勞曰忠，善則推君曰忠。死衛社稷曰忠，以德匡君曰忠，以孝事君曰忠，安不擇事曰忠，中能應外曰忠。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"仁畜義丰功曰仁，殺身成志曰仁，克己复禮曰仁，宽信敏惠曰仁，功施於民曰仁，愛仁利物曰仁。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"義推功尚善曰義，以禮節行曰義，取而不貪曰義，行禮不疚曰義，見利能讓曰義，以公滅私曰義，製事得宣曰義。","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"禮躬俭中節曰禮。審節而和曰禮，著誠去伪曰禮。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"智敬而不忘曰智，尊明勝患曰智，摧芒折廉曰智，擇任而往曰智，能治大官曰智，臨事不感曰智，知育知默曰智。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"直守追如矢曰直，言行不邪曰直，质而中正曰直，正人之曲曰直，折獄在中曰直，孝弟成性曰直，小心敬事曰直。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"信思難不趨官曰信，周仁承命曰信，立言可复信信，守禮不违曰信。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"钦肅敬而承上曰钦。","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"良謀猷歸美曰良。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"類勤施無私曰類，不忝前哲曰類。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"度心能製義曰度，進退可軌曰度，守法緯民曰度，從容有常曰度，禮儀次善曰度。","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"戴典禮不衍曰戴，愛人好禮曰戴。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"懷仁敬短折日懷，執義去位曰懷。","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"荒內外淫亂曰荒。","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_89_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_89","textTraditional":"悫誠以致志曰悫。","sentenceOrder":161}],"overrides":{}}